<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells vanadium at average $3.308/lb.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells vanadium at average $3.308/lb.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 321,518 pounds or 145.8 tonnes of vanadium pentoxide to Pechiney World Trade, the sole buyer, for an average price of $3.308 per pound.</p>
<p>The total value of the sale was $1,063,598.</p>
<p>The next offering is on January 23.</p>
<p>((--New York Commodities 212-859-1646))</p>
